rged $4.50/cube. | *cube refers to 1 cubic meter | Bulk Water Purchases and Accounts: | Accounts: Bulk water rates are $10.00/Cube for Commercial & $5.00/Cube for Residential. | Account set up required. Please come into the Town Administration Office for details. | Infrastructure Replacement Fees | The Town of Valleyview is introducing Infrastruc", "ainage systems. These fees will be phased in over four years and will appear on your utility bill each month. | The fee is based on a “user pay” principle , meaning each portion directly supports the service it funds: | $14.79 for water infrastructure (applied to all water accounts) | $9.25 for sewer infrastructure (applied to all sewer accounts) | $9.35 for drainage infrastructure (applied to all utility accounts) |", " a “user pay” principle , meaning each portion directly supports the service it funds: | $14.79 for water infrastructure (applied to all water accounts) | $9.25 for sewer infrastructure (applied to all sewer accounts) | $9.35 for drainage infrastructure (applied to all utility accounts) | The phasing will be as follows for all fees combined: | 2026: $8.35 per month | 2027: $16.69 per month | 2028: $25.04 per month | ", " all water accounts) | $9.25 for sewer infrastructure (applied to all sewer accounts) | $9.35 for drainage infrastructure (applied to all utility accounts) | The phasing will be as follows for all fees combined: | 2026: $8.35 per month | 2027: $16.69 per month | 2028: $25.04 per month | 2029 and onward: $33.39 per month | This approach ensures the Town can sustainably maintain essential services while keeping the imp", "r month | 2029 and onward: $33.39 per month | This approach ensures the Town can sustainably maintain essential services while keeping the impact on residents manageable. | Sewer: | Minimum rate for Residential Sewer is $23.00. | Minimum rate for Commercial Sewer is $29.00. | Calculation for sewer billing in relation to water cost is 40% for Residential and Commercial. | Garbage: | Residential garbage pickup charge i", "idential Sewer is $23.00. | Minimum rate for Commercial Sewer is $29.00. | Calculation for sewer billing in relation to water cost is 40% for Residential and Commercial. | Garbage: | Residential garbage pickup charge is $23.00/monthly. | An admin fee of $2.33 is payable monthly by each account. | Garbage pickup for north of 50th Avenue is weekly on Tuesdays; south of 50th Avenue is weekly on Thursdays. | Commercial B", "monthly. | An admin fee of $2.33 is payable monthly by each account. | Garbage pickup for north of 50th Avenue is weekly on Tuesdays; south of 50th Avenue is weekly on Thursdays. | Commercial Bin Rentals: | 6 Yard Bin – $80.00/3 Yard Bin – $43.50/2 Yard Bin – $32.50. | Pick up Rates for 2 & 3 Yard Bins are $20.00/per dump. 6 Yard Bins are $35.00/per dump. | Recycling: | Residential Recycling charge is $12.00/monthly.", "on Tuesdays; south of 50th Avenue is weekly on Thursdays. | Commercial Bin Rentals: | 6 Yard Bin – $80.00/3 Yard Bin – $43.50/2 Yard Bin – $32.50. | Pick up Rates for 2 & 3 Yard Bins are $20.00/per dump. 6 Yard Bins are $35.00/per dump. | Recycling: | Residential Recycling charge is $12.00/monthly. | Commercial Recycling charge is $30.00/monthly. | Billing Procedures | Each month you will receive a bill outlining you", "lity charges. | The Town Administration Office accepts cheques, cash, interac, bank, internet banking payments. | If there is an amount owing on your utility bill, your gas and water may be disconnected. There will be a $50.00 reconnection fee per service to have the services turned back on. | Utilities Consumer Advocate | The Office of the Utilities Consumer Advocate – Educate, Advocate and Mediate | Visit https://u"], "via": "Utilities & Fees"}, {"url": "https://valleyview.ca/for-business/valleyview-economic-development-strategy/", "lines": [], "via": "Valleyview Economic Development Strategy"}, {"url": "https://valleyview.ca/2026-strategic-plan/", "lines": [], "via": "