ekly/Monthly Rates | ", "or to set up. | Picnic/Day Use/Visitor/Extra Vehicle: $6.50 per vehicle, everyone entering the park must register license plate at the office to obtain a parking pass - picnic area is first come, first serve | Firewood: $15.00 | | Weekly/Monthly Rates | Weekly: | Unserviced site $186.00 | 15 amp power/water $244.00 | 30 amp power/water $262.00 | 15/30/50 amp power/water (Area E only) $274.00 | 30 amp power/water/sewe", "- picnic area is first come, first serve | Firewood: $15.00 | | Weekly/Monthly Rates | Weekly: | Unserviced site $186.00 | 15 amp power/water $244.00 | 30 amp power/water $262.00 | 15/30/50 amp power/water (Area E only) $274.00 | 30 amp power/water/sewer $298.00 | 50 amp power/water/sewer $340.00 | Prime 30 amp power/water $298.00 | Prime 30 or 50 amp power/water/sewer $340.00 | Monthly: | 30 amp power/water/sewer $9", "30 amp power/water $262.00 | 15/30/50 amp power/water (Area E only) $274.00 | 30 amp power/water/sewer $298.00 | 50 amp power/water/sewer $340.00 | Prime 30 amp power/water $298.00 | Prime 30 or 50 amp power/water/sewer $340.00 | Monthly: | 30 amp power/water/sewer $930.00 | Prime 30 amp power/water/sewer $1060.00 (sites 26, 27, 28) | We have specific monthly rate sites in the campground. Once filled, we are only abl", "o hold your reservation and require 48 hours notice for cancellations or date changes. If you fail to notify us within 48 hours that you will not be staying we will charge your credit card the cancellation fee, which is $40.00 per site. | We do require a 2-night minimum for weekend stays and a 3-night minimum for long weekend stays. | Campground Rules | Revised July 2025 | The Devon Lions Campground is a peaceful tra", "site if you are tent camping. Only one camping unit is permitted on each site. No one under 18 years of age is allowed to camp unless accompanied by a parent or guardian. An extra 4-person tent is allowed on an RV site ($10.50 per night) only if space permits and must be registe